Why the weights differ from the code
------------------------------------
These weights are trained in part on the Zenseact Open Dataset, which is released under
CC BY-SA 4.0. Share-alike propagates to derivative works. Whether trained model weights are a
derivative work of their training data is legally unsettled and has not been decided by a court.
This project takes the conservative reading: the weights are licensed share-alike, matching the
strictest licence of any corpus they were trained on.

If you need weights without that condition, the v73 (sunny) and v69 (night) checkpoints train on
PandaSet only, which is CC BY 4.0 with no share-alike, and score within half a CIPO point of these
baselines.

Attribution required by the training corpora
--------------------------------------------
PandaSet (c) Scale AI, Inc. and Hesai Technology Co., Ltd. - CC BY 4.0 plus Dataset Terms.
  The Dataset Terms carry into derived data: attribute Scale AI and Hesai; do not use their names
  or logos beyond attribution; do not use the data to identify any individual.
Zenseact Open Dataset (c) Zenseact AB - CC BY-SA 4.0.
Mapillary Vistas (c) Mapillary AB - research use.
Cityscapes (c) Daimler AG, MPI Informatics, TU Darmstadt - research use.

Mapillary Vistas and Cityscapes are licensed for research use and are part of the SUNNY corpus
only. The night model (v79) is trained on PandaSet and ZOD alone.
